      "revision": {
        "title": "To be: inkor shakli",
        "description": "am not / is not (isn't) / are not (aren't).",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Maqsad\n\nBu darsda **to be** fe'lining **inkor** shakli bilan gap tuzishni o'rganasiz: biror narsa *shunday emas* deyishni." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 3,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "Inkor qilish uchun **to be** dan keyin **not** qo'shiladi:\n\n- **I am not** — men ...emasman\n- **you are not** — sen ...emassan\n- **he / she / it is not** — u ...emas\n- **we / they are not** — biz / ular ...emas\n\nQisqartma shakllar:\n\n- is not → **isn't**\n- are not → **aren't**\n\n**Diqqat:** standart ingliz tilida *amn't* odatda ishlatilmaydi; buning o'rniga **I'm not** ishlatiladi." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "- **I'm not** a teacher. I'm a student.\n- **She isn't** at home. She is at work.\n- **It isn't** cold today.\n- **They aren't** from Tashkent. They are from Andijan.\n- **We aren't** ready." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-BE-NEGATIVE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "He ___ at home. (u uyda emas)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "isn't" }, { "id": "b", "text": "aren't" }, { "id": "c", "text": "am not" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "**Ko'p uchraydigan xato:** inkorda **not** ni tushirib qoldirmang va olmoshga mos shaklni tanlang.\n\n- Noto'g'ri: *He no is at home.*\n- To'g'ri: **He isn't at home.**\n\n- Noto'g'ri: *They isn't students.*\n- To'g'ri: **They aren't students.**" }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-BE-NEGATIVE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "They ___ ready. (ular tayyor emas)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "isn't" }, { "id": "b", "text": "aren't" }, { "id": "c", "text": "am not" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-BE-NEGATIVE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "\"is not\" ning qisqartma shakli qaysi?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "isn't" }, { "id": "b", "text": "amn't" }, { "id": "c", "text": "aren't" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "MASTERY_TEST",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-BE-NEGATIVE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "I ___ from Tashkent. (men Toshkentdan emasman)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "am not" }, { "id": "b", "text": "isn't" }, { "id": "c", "text": "aren't" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "contentKey": "ENG-A1-005-BE-QUESTIONS",
      "slug": "eng-a1-005-be-questions",
      "sortOrder": 20,
