      "revision": {
        "title": "To be bilan savollar",
        "description": "Are you...? Is he...? va What / Where / How old savollari.",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Maqsad\n\nBu darsda **to be** bilan savol berishni o'rganasiz va odam bilan tanishishda kerak bo'ladigan asosiy savollarni ishlata olasiz." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 3,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "**Ha/yo'q savollarida** *to be* fe'li oldinga chiqadi:\n\n- You are a student. → **Are you** a student?\n- He is at home. → **Is he** at home?\n\nAsosiy savol so'zlari bilan:\n\n- **What is your name?** — Isming(iz) nima?\n- **Where are you from?** — Qayerdansiz?\n- **How old are you?** — Necha yoshdasiz?\n\nBu savollarda ham *to be* (is / are) tushib qolmasligi kerak." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "- **A:** What is your name? **B:** My name is Kamola.\n- **A:** Where are you from? **B:** I am from Fergana.\n- **A:** How old are you? **B:** I am nineteen.\n- **A:** Are you a student? **B:** Yes, I am.\n- **A:** Is he a teacher? **B:** No, he isn't." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-BE-QUESTIONS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "___ you a student?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "Are" }, { "id": "b", "text": "Is" }, { "id": "c", "text": "Am" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "**Qisqa javoblar:**\n\n- Are you a student? — **Yes, I am.** / **No, I'm not.**\n- Is she a doctor? — **Yes, she is.** / **No, she isn't.**\n\n**Ko'p uchraydigan xato:** savolda *to be* ni tushirib qoldirmang.\n\n- Noto'g'ri: *Where you from?*\n- To'g'ri: **Where are you from?**" }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-BE-QUESTIONS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "___ she from Bukhara?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "Is" }, { "id": "b", "text": "Are" }, { "id": "c", "text": "Am" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-BE-QUESTIONS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "Kimningdir yoshini so'ramoqchisiz. Qaysi savol to'g'ri?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "How old are you?" }, { "id": "b", "text": "How old you are?" }, { "id": "c", "text": "How old is you?" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "MASTERY_TEST",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-BE-QUESTIONS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "Kimningdir ismini so'ramoqchisiz. Qaysi savol to'g'ri?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "What is your name?" }, { "id": "b", "text": "What your name?" }, { "id": "c", "text": "Who is your name?" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          }
        ]
      }
