      "prerequisiteContentKeys": ["ENG-A1-005-BE-QUESTIONS"],
      "revision": {
        "title": "Sonlar va shaxsiy ma'lumot",
        "description": "0-100 sonlar, yosh, telefon raqami va oddiy shaxsiy ma'lumot.",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Maqsad\n\nBu darsda **sonlar** (0-100) va oddiy **shaxsiy ma'lumot**ni aytishni o'rganasiz: yoshingiz, telefon raqamingiz va qayerdanligingiz." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 4,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "Sonlar:\n\n- **0** = zero, **1** = one, **2** = two ... **10** = ten, **11** = eleven, **12** = twelve.\n- 13-19 oxirida **-teen**: thir**teen** (13), four**teen** (14), fif**teen** (15) ... nine**teen** (19).\n- 20, 30, 40 ... oxirida **-ty**: twen**ty** (20), thir**ty** (30), for**ty** (40) ... nine**ty** (90).\n- Qo'shma sonlar chiziqcha bilan: twenty-**one** (21), thirty-**five** (35), forty-**two** (42).\n- **100** = one hundred.\n\nEsda tuting: **thirteen** (13) va **thirty** (30) — bular boshqa sonlar.\n\n**Telefon raqamlari** odatda **raqamma-raqam** (birma-bir) o'qiladi, bitta katta son sifatida emas. Masalan, `4 7 2` → **four seven two**." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "Shaxsiy ma'lumot namunalari (barchasi o'ylab topilgan):\n\n- **I am 20 years old.**\n- **I am from Uzbekistan.**\n- **A:** How old are you? **B:** I am twenty-one.\n- **A:** Where are you from? **B:** I am from Namangan.\n- Telefon raqami raqamma-raqam o'qiladi: `9 0 — 1 2 3` → **nine zero, one two three**." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PERSONAL-INFO"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "Yoshingizni aytmoqchisiz: 25. Qaysi biri to'g'ri?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "I am 25 years old." }, { "id": "b", "text": "I have 25 years." }, { "id": "c", "text": "I am 25 year." } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "**Ko'p uchraydigan xatolar:**\n\n1. Yoshni aytishda *have* ishlatilmaydi.\n   - Noto'g'ri: *I have 25 years.* → To'g'ri: **I am 25 years old.**\n2. Telefon raqamini bitta katta son qilib o'qimang — har bir raqamni alohida ayting.\n   - `4 7 2` → **four seven two**, *four hundred seventy-two* emas." }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-NUMBERS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "Telefon raqamidagi `4 7 2` qanday o'qiladi?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "four seven two" }, { "id": "b", "text": "forty-seven two" }, { "id": "c", "text": "four hundred seventy-two" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PERSONAL-INFO"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "Qayerdanligingizni ayting. Qaysi biri to'g'ri?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "I am from Uzbekistan." }, { "id": "b", "text": "I from Uzbekistan." }, { "id": "c", "text": "I am from Uzbekistan country." } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "MASTERY_TEST",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-NUMBERS", "ENG-A1-PERSONAL-INFO"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "multiple_choice", "prompt": "Qaysi gaplar to'g'ri? (bir nechta javob bo'lishi mumkin)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "forty-two = 42" }, { "id": "b", "text": "I am 25 years old." }, { "id": "c", "text": "I have 25 years." }, { "id": "d", "text": "one hundred = 10" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a", "b"] } }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
